{title: Faithfully Brought In}
{subtitle: 2 Chronicles 31:12; 31:13–15; 31:20–21}
{key: Bb}
{tempo: 81}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [Bb] | [Bb] | [Eb] | [Gm7] |
| [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]They faithfully brought [Eb]in the contributions
[Gm7]The tithes and the [Eb]dedicated gifts
[Bb]Conaniah the Levite [Eb]was in charge
[Gm7]Managing every holy [Eb]thing
His [Cm7]brother Shimei was second in com[Eb]mand
Serving under the [Bb]King [Eb]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Bb]Jehiel and Azaziah [Eb]served as supervisors
[Gm7]Nahath and Asahel [Eb]too
By ap[Bb]pointment of King Hezekiah
[Eb]And Azariah the offi[Gm7]cial
They dis[Eb]tributed the gifts fairly
[Cm7]To the priests and Le[Eb]vites [F]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Gm]Kore son of Imnah [Eb]was the gatekeeper
[Bb]At the East Gate he [F]stood
[Gm]In charge of freewill offerings
For God [Eb]and for the LORD
He dis[Cm7]tributed the consecrated [Eb]gifts
With a faithful [Bb]heart
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Interlude}
| [Bb] [F/A] | [Eb] | [Gm] | [Eb] |

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Bb]Eden and Miniamin helped [Eb]him out
[Gm]Jeshua and She[Eb]maiah
In the [Bb]towns of the priests they worked
Di[Eb]viding by their turns
To [Gm]old and young alike they gave [Eb]
With steady [F]hands
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Outro}
He [Cm7]sought his God [Eb]and worked wholehearted[Bb]ly
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Outro (instrumental)}
